<section aria-labelledby="status-heading">
  <h2 id="status-heading">Two milestones. One local-first direction.</h2>
  <p><strong>Desktop 0.11.0 is released.</strong> Complete Textual workflows, live countdowns, encrypted backups and session locking are available now. Python 3.11–3.13 is validated on Windows, macOS and Linux. D2FA v1 and cryptographic parameters are unchanged.</p>
  <p><strong>D2FA Watch 0.3.0 is the first ecosystem extension.</strong> Guided setup, password-only sessions, encrypted local storage and interoperability tests are in place. Selected-account transfer is the next design step, not a shipped feature.</p>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/wrogistefan/desktop-2fa/releases/tag/v0.11.0">Desktop release notes</a> · <a href="/docs/changelog">Full changelog</a> · <a href="#watch">Watch progress and planned benefits</a></p>
</section>
